msgid "Round Robin"
msgstr ""

#: src/components/organisms/MatchmakingReport.re.mjs:835
#~ msgid "Round Robin and Balanced Round Robin lead early. Competitive+ catches up after roughly 20 rounds and tracks Balanced Round Robin from there to round 100."
